omx-clap-host (0.32.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ci: the host-verbs step fetches the staged protocol build's own commit
  * packaging: the CLAP floor is 1.2.10 everywhere, one number
  * packaging: a floor is the version each distribution's build is built and
    tested against
  * Release 0.32.2
  * packaging: the Catalan pack took the catalog over in 0.32.1
  * ci: the host-verbs check reads the declarations of the protocol build it
    installs
  * packaging: a build takes plugin-db below 0.5
  * packaging: the Catalan pack takes the catalog over from 0.32.2
  * host: node_label, a client's label on a hosted node's pretty-name
    (plugin-hostd#35)
  * tests: a client's node_label joins a hosted node's pretty-name
    (plugin-hostd#35)
  * debian: libomx-clap-core-dev depends on clap-headers, with a floor and a
    ceiling
  * gitignore: tests/hosted_cost_bench_lv2, the LV2 build of the chain bench

